<span class="mobile-fisher-body"><span class="c-hi">  ( ◕‿◕ )</span></span>
<span class="mobile-fisher-body"><span class="c-muted">   /│╲ <span class="c-dim">·</span></span></span>
<span class="mobile-fisher-body"><span class="c-muted">  ╱ │ ╲<span class="c-dim">│</span></span></span>
<span class="c-muted">    └┘  <span class="c-dim">│</span></span>
