<span class="c-dim">         ·</span>
<span class="c-dim">         │</span>
<span class="c-dim">   ┌─────┤</span>
<span class="fisher-body"><span class="c-hi">  ( ◕‿◕ )</span></span>
<span class="fisher-body"><span class="c-muted">   /│╲</span></span>
<span class="fisher-body"><span class="c-muted">  ╱ │ ╲</span></span>
<span class="c-muted">    └┘</span>
<span class="water-line">≈≈≈≈≈≈≈≈≈≈≈≈≈≈≈≈</span>
